# Narrow on purpose. A blanket `* text=auto` would renormalise every file in
# the repository and show up as "everything changed"; this only covers the
# files where the line ending is a functional requirement rather than a
# preference.
#
# sbatch refuses a job script containing CRLF outright:
#   sbatch: error: Batch script contains DOS line breaks (\r\n)
# and this repository is developed on Windows, where a checkout would
# otherwise produce exactly that.
*.sh text eol=lf
